---
description: React UI must not own routing policy
globs: "frontend/**/*.{ts,tsx}"
alwaysApply: false
---

# Frontend

- Read `frontend/AGENTS.md` (RouteDeck preface first) before editing UI.
- MUST NOT encode Proxy / Direct / Block rules in TypeScript.
- After a user action, load a snapshot. Events are not the source of truth.
- UI language is English.
- MUST NOT add ESLint as a required gate. Typecheck with the existing `tsc` scripts.
- Unknown or failed protection MUST NOT look like Active.
- Untitled UI: `npx untitledui@latest add` from `frontend/`; never `init`. See ADR-0007.
